  "body": "Looking for your next project without the typical planning headaches? This is a ready-to-go opportunity in the heart of Stanmore Bay. We are offering 619 Whangaparaoa Road (also known as 17A Arklow Road) with all the heavy lifting finished.\r\n\r\nWith Resource Consent (RC), Building Consent (BC), and Engineering Plan Approval (EPA) already in place, you can skip the years of red tape and move straight to construction.\r\n\r\nSituated on an 867m2 site zoned for Business - Mixed Use, this development has been meticulously planned to maximize yield and appeal. The design features a smart, multi-level layout that utilizes the natural topography to provide elevation and views.\r\n\r\n8 Modern New Builds: A mix of high-density, contemporary terrace-style homes.\r\n\r\nSmart Design: Units are positioned to capture natural light, featuring private decks and functional outdoor spaces.\r\n\r\nFull Infrastructure Ready: EPA is secured, meaning the site works and connections are cleared for takeoff.\r\n\r\nAllocated Parking: The plan includes a dedicated parking court for residents, a premium feature for this density of build.\r\n\r\nPrime Location.\r\nThis isn't just a site; it's a lifestyle destination. \r\n\r\nFuture residents will benefit from being:\r\n* Walking distance to the Coast Plaza and local supermarkets\r\n* Minutes away from the golden sands of Stanmore Bay Beach and the Leisure Centre\r\n* Highly Visible: The dual frontage/address provides excellent accessibility and profile\r\n\r\nIn today's market, time is money. By purchasing a site with BC and EPA ready, you mitigate the risk of rising holding costs and changing council regulations. Whether you are a seasoned developer looking to keep your crews busy or an investor seeking a de-risked asset, this Stanmore Bay gem is the ultimate \"plug-and-play\" development.\r\n\r\nThe paperwork is done. The vision is set. All that's missing is the builder.\r\n\r\nCall Ian TODAY 0211592078 to secure this outstanding opportunity!",
